{
  "$schema": "https://json-schema.org/draft/2020-12/schema",
  "$id": "https://github.com/x-yy-x/tool_realization/schema/filelists.schema.json",
  "title": "filelists.json",
  "description": "L1 扫描层的路由产物。一个文件一条，只记录相对路径和它要交给哪些提取器。只收录至少有一个类别的文件；没有类别的文件不出现。这是路由表，不是全树清单。",
  "$comment": "Frozen 2026-10-26. 只有 path 和 classes 两个字段；不要往记录里加 lex / size / carrier / strength / sig / root / generated_at / stats。classes 必须按 S1,S3,S4,S5,S6,S7 升序；JSON Schema 不能表达数组顺序，由测试校验。",
  "type": "array",
  "items": {
    "type": "object",
    "required": ["path", "classes"],
    "additionalProperties": false,
    "properties": {
      "path": {
        "type": "string",
        "minLength": 1,
        "description": "相对源码根的路径，包含文件名，统一用正斜杠。不得以 / 开头，不得含反斜杠、双斜杠、. 或 .. 路径段，不得以 / 结尾，不得是 Windows 盘符或 ~ 路径。",
        "pattern": "^(?!/)(?!.*//).*[^/]$",
        "not": {
          "anyOf": [
            { "pattern": "\\\\" },
            { "pattern": "(^|/)\\.\\.?($|/)" },
            { "pattern": "^[A-Za-z]:" },
            { "pattern": "^~" },
            { "pattern": "[\\n\\r]" }
          ]
        }
      },
      "classes": {
        "type": "array",
        "minItems": 1,
        "uniqueItems": true,
        "description": "该文件要交给哪些提取器。非空、去重、按 S1,S3,S4,S5,S6,S7 升序。S2 已移除，不出现。",
        "items": {
          "type": "string",
          "enum": ["S1", "S3", "S4", "S5", "S6", "S7"]
        }
      }
    }
  },
  "examples": [
    [
      {
        "path": "base/hiviewdfx/hilog/bundle.json",
        "classes": ["S3", "S6"]
      },
      {
        "path": "base/hiviewdfx/hilog/BUILD.gn",
        "classes": ["S1", "S4", "S5", "S7"]
      }
    ]
  ]
}
